{"id":2678,"date":"2026-06-10T12:37:29","date_gmt":"2026-06-10T12:37:29","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2678"},"modified":"2026-10-02T10:13:09","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T10:13:09","slug":"kota-green-snow-blast-finish-stone","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/kota-green-snow-blast-finish-stone\/","title":{"rendered":"Kota Green Snow Blast Finish Stone"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"650\">Kota Green Snow Blast Finish is a premium natural stone known for its distinctive textured surface and attractive green appearance. The snow blast treatment enhances the natural character of the stone while creating a subtle, uniform texture that offers both visual appeal and improved slip resistance.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"971\">Widely preferred for residential, commercial, hospitality, and landscape projects, this finish provides a perfect balance between durability and functionality. Its natural green shades and textured surface complement a variety of architectural styles, making it suitable for contemporary as well as traditional designs.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1269\">The stone is highly durable and performs exceptionally well in outdoor environments where safety and aesthetics are equally important. Its rugged yet elegant appearance makes it a popular choice for pathways, garden areas, courtyards, terraces, pool surrounds, and exterior flooring applications.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1533\">Combining strength, low maintenance, and timeless natural beauty, Kota Green Snow Blast Finish remains a preferred choice for architects, builders, and designers seeking a premium natural stone solution with enhanced surface texture and long-lasting performance.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1538\" \/>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11k4bfl\" data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1565\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1543\"